a panacea is defined as a remedy for all  difficulties and diseases it is a  medicine potion or other item that can  pull a patient back from the brink of  death and save someone from even the  worst of circumstances a cure-all it's a  wonderful idea one that would save  countless lives put a stop to untold  needless suffering and improve the human  experience on a permanent global scale  unfortunately anyone claiming to have  the solution to all problems is likely  just trying to sell you something unless  of course that person works at the scp  foundation then they just might be  telling you the truth because they just  might be telling you about scp-500  scp-500 also known as the panacea is  completely unassuming in appearance all  it consists of is a single plastic pill  bottle filled with exactly 47 red pills  this is all that remains of the world's  only known miracle cure when the pills  were first discovered by the foundation  they were used in a variety of  experiments in order to determine the  limits if any of their curative powers  they tested the pills on everything from  diseases like cancer to physical  injuries like a broken femur in each and  every case one pill taken orally cured  the test subject of all symptoms within  a matter of hours after determining that  scp-500 could treat natural ailments the  foundation scientists decided to apply  it to more unnatural ills two pills were  authorized for use with  scp-008 to be administered to class d  personnel who had been exposed to it at  the time of this experiment's approval  there were 57 pills in the can scp-008  is a complex prion or a misfolded  protein with the ability to change the  shape of correctly formed variants of  the same protein brions are considered  to be the cause of mad cow disease among  many other debilitating  neurodegenerative diseases  scp-008 is no exception to the  devastation it takes what is terrifying  about other prion diseases the loss of  cognition the onset of dementia the  certain death and cranks it up to 11. 20  hours after the onset of symptoms the  infected person will slip into a coma  but that is not the end of their  suffering the nervous system is damaged  and the cells have begun to necrotize  but the infected person is still able to  move they shamble around on two legs  they crawl they grab and they bite they  seek out stimuli that indicate the  presence of a living uninfected human  and they will attempt to devour it the  only way to stop an infected individual  is to completely destroy their brain  essentially it is a zombie plague  understandably the foundation has a  vested interest in curing and containing  scp-008 and so the promise of the  panacea was an enticing one for the  purposes of the experiment a member of  the class-d personnel was randomly  selected and exposed to scp-008  within three hours he began to exhibit  symptoms running a fever of 105 degrees  and coughing and vomiting uncontrollably  wanting to see if it would be possible  to use scp-500 as a cure even in the  latest stages of the disease the  scientists conducting the experiment  allowed the symptoms to progress with  the test subject eventually slipping  into a coma once comatose the cell  degeneration quickened until he began to  move again his dull unfocused eyes  roamed around the room and he lurched  towards a member of the research staff  biting down on her arm of course she was  clad in hazmat gear in order to prevent  infection but the class d no longer had  the cognitive capacity to understand  that the researcher seized the  opportunity to wrench his jaws open and  stuff one of the scp-500 pills down his  throat once the pill had been swallowed  she vacated the room and the test  subject was quarantined after two hours  the research team returned to  investigate the results of their test  what they found was something amazing  sitting in the cell was a completely  lucid healthy if a bit confused man with  no signs of the disease that had  previously ravaged his body the panacea  was able to cure scp-008  even at its most advanced stages so they  knew that scp-500 could cure a prion  disease like 008 but what else could it  cure what was the extent of its  marvelous medical power if any could it  cure an ailment with virtually no basis  in modern medical understanding next one  pill was approved and allocated for  testing with scp-409  scp-409 is a rock formation resembling a  large quartz crystal it is kept in a  sealed granite case and no one is  permitted to touch it with any substance  other than granite unless during active  experimentation anyone who comes into  physical contact with  scp-409 suffers a peculiar and  nightmarish fate they will immediately  begin to crystallize their body  effectively turning into rock the  crystallization occurs at a rate of  roughly one inch per minute and will  continue until the victim's entire body  inside and out has solidified it is an  incredibly painful process and thought  to be completely irreversible subject  409-d5 was chosen at random from a group  of class-d personnel as the guinea pig  for the next scp-500 experiment he was  exposed to a  scp-409 touching it with his index  finger this small touch was more than  enough to seal his fate upon contact the  finger immediately began to crystallize  spreading up his hand his wrist and his  arm over the course of several minutes  as he screamed in agony it was difficult  to administer scp-500 with all this  screaming but a researcher was able to  close his mouth long enough for the pill  to be swallowed within a few hours the  foundation researchers watched as the  crystallization process slowed and then  stopped after nine days in a foundation  hospital ward the crystallization  process had completely reversed and the  man was returned to normal he still  reported phantom pain in the formerly  crystallized parts of his body but even  that cleared up after several more days  after the incredible success of the  scp-008 and scp-409 trials the  foundation was desperate to synthesize  their own version of scp-500  a multitude of experiments were  performed in an attempt to isolate the  active ingredient in the pills but every  time they found what appeared to be the  miracle aspect of the anomalous pills  they found that they were unable to  synthesize it and have it produce the  same results as the real thing extensive  drug trials were conducted leaving a  trail of injured and dead d-class  personnel in their wake with the  traditional pharmacological route  eliminated the foundation decided to  expose some of the pills to a variety of  other scps in an attempt to somehow  recreate or amplify their effects most  of the results were lackluster or  completely uneventful however some did  yield notable results one pill was taken  from scp-500 and placed inside of  scp-914  which is a large clockwork device with a  multitude of settings ranging from very  fine to rough that is capable of  transforming matter in various ways the  pill was run through scp-914 on the fine  setting and the machine produced a small  silver locket which would later be  classified as scp-427  scp-427 retains some of the healing  properties of its original form able to  regenerate damaged cells and purge  infection from the body when it is  opened and exposed to a living subject  during testing it was able to cure the  common cold in a matter of minutes  however unlike scp-500 the lock had  produced notable negative side effects  prolonged exposure to scp-427's healing  properties increased cell regeneration  and the optimization of bodily systems  beyond a healthy threshold exposure for  more than an hour turn the test subjects  into shapeless masses of tissue  nicknamed flesh beasts these flesh  beasts are highly aggressive and will  attack anything in sight unless they are  put down  scp-427 was intended to be a potential  replacement for scp-5000 once the  limited number of pills ran out but the  potential risks of its use have led to  it being shelved indefinitely with all  attempts to create a different yet  equally effective version of scp-500  ending in failure the foundation instead  tried to find a way to duplicate it in  one case an experiment was conducted  with the intent to produce more of the  panacea pills not using chemistry and  compounding but instead opting for a  much more unusual method after a request  was submitted and approved five pills  from the bottle were selected to be  exposed to scp-038  scp-038 is a highly unique plant  resembling a common apple tree however  it can grow far more than just apples  the tree can clone any object that  touches its bark producing the clone on  its branches where an ordinary tree  would bear fruit the five allocated  pills were touched to the fabric of the  tree and sure enough clones of the red  capsules began to sprout within seconds  but while the tree was able to clone  pills that looked identical to scp-500  their effectiveness was sorely lacking  compared to the originals clone pills  were only approximately 30 percent  effective in curing the infections they  were used to treat as opposed to the 100  effectiveness with the real deal the  clone pills were set aside for treatment  of less severe infections and all the  originals were returned to their storage  container well almost all of them as the  experiment was wrapping up a d-class  participating in the experiment managed  to pocket one of the five pills  allocated for the test the pill's  absence was not noticed until the  following day at which point it had  already been ingested by the thief when  interrogated the man admitted that he  had stolen the pill in order to cure a  particularly nasty hangover after his  usual method of pickle juice a bacon  sandwich and aspirin had failed the  employee was promptly terminated and  security around scp-500 was tightened  significantly following this incident no  personnel below level 3 were permitted  to handle scp-500 in any capacity when  it was initially brought into the  foundation there were approximately 57  pills in scp-500 container and currently  only 47 remain  due to the limited amount of pills and  inability thus far to duplicate them in  an equivalently effective form  experimentation with scp-500 has been  drastically limited most requests for  experimentation or allocation of pills  are promptly denied these requests have  included a dr gibbons who asked that two  pills be given to him for his personal  medkit as well as a proposed experiment  involving scp-253  a group of cells which bear some strong  resemblances to cancer several concerned  personnel at the foundation have worried  that scp-500 may have another anomalous  effect that it may cause obsessive  fixation in those who spend a great deal  of time with it leading them to  experiment with it again and again  unable to let it go until they crack an  unsolvable code  this has been immediately dismissed as  trivial and unfounded by the scp-500  research team surely their obsessive  work with the pills is their own choice  but perhaps the concerned parties have a  point after all there are a few things  more compelling than a miracle cure and  there is arguably no greater scientific  discovery that could be made no higher  mountain than one could climb and there  is nothing more maddening than having  that life-saving pill in your grasp and  watch the number dwindle down one pill  at a time like grains of sand slipping  between your fingers with only 47 pills  left and no way to recreate them on the  horizon perhaps the panacea is both a  blessing and a curse a tantalizing  glimpse at what humanity could have but  will never truly achieve but hey maybe  they'll crack the code if they just try  one more experiment and why not try  there will still be 46 left and then 45  and then  well let's just hope they figure it out  before they truly are all gone now go  check out  scp-999 the tickle monster and the  ipod's  scp-131 for more helpful anomalies
 

